[PrintTextModified Text:虽然地震<br>确实可能导致房间一片混乱……|#0103Trial07_Alisa016| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right
