@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:就算真的发生了地震，<br>这跟案件也扯不上什么关系吧？|#0103Trial07_Alisa019| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:说到这个，<br>我们真的确定那是同一个人偶吗？<br>会不会只是长得相似的另一个人偶呢……|#0103Trial07_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，这一点你们大可放心，<br>因为我用颜料在人偶上做了标记。|#0103Trial07_Margo019| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:那是我昨晚特意用招待所附近的花朵<br>碾碎制成的颜料。<br>……剩下的花就随手扔在那边了。|#0103Trial07_Margo020| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:所以绝对不可能是相似的人偶……<br>这毫无疑问是【同一个】人偶。|#0103Trial07_Margo021| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:……这么说来，招待所前的石砖地面上<br>确实留有类似血迹的痕迹呢。|#0103Trial07_Nanoka011| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmR3,ArmL1,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
